{"product":{"id":8028918186240,"title":"King Of The Night T-SHIRT","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\"King Of The Night\" UNISEX deep V-neck T-shirt with an extended back \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eMade of high-quality materials that ensure comfort and allow the skin to breathe.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe fabric contains elastane, which is stretchy and fits the figure. The material is wear-resistant and does not lose its shape after repeated washing. Does not fade over time.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003ePrint:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eHypoallergenic paint\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSuitable for washing in the washing machine. It is recommended to use the delicate wash (hand wash) mode.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eComposition:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCotton 98%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpandex 2%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCare guide:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eHand wash\/machine wash up to 30°C\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe maximum ironing temperature is 110°C\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDo not bleach\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSuitable for dry cleaning\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDrying on a horizontal surface in a straightened state\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTumble drying is prohibited\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","vendor":"REMPIRE","product_type":"t-shirt","created_at":"2022-11-02T16:03:50+02:00","handle":"king-of-the-night-deep-cut-t-shirt-with-an-extended-back","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:12+03:00","published_at":"2022-11-02T16:03:51+02:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"king, REMPIRE MERCH, REMPIRE UNIQUE, slim, t shirt","variants":[{"id":43377809817856,"product_id":8028918186240,"title":"S-M","price":"27.00","sku":"","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"S-M","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2022-11-02T16:03:50+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:12+03:00","taxable":false,"barcode":"NA","grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"EUR","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":43377809850624,"product_id":8028918186240,"title":"M-L","price":"27.00","sku":"","position":2,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"M-L","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2022-11-02T16:03:50+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:12+03:00","taxable":false,"barcode":"NA","grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"EUR","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks"